Subject: [qnx-porter 0001] qnx-source
Source: deterministic rule
Reason: `strdup` is in <string.h>, which src/cbortojson.c already includes, so a strict feature-test macro hid it. -D_QNX_SOURCE exposes POSIX and QNX extensions in QNX's headers, as _GNU_SOURCE does on glibc.
Error: /home/chirag/qnx-porter/ports-aarch64le/tinycbor/work/src/src/cbortojson.c:399:20: error: implicit declaration of function 'strdup'; did you mean 'strcmp'? [-Werror=implicit-function-declaration]
